@startuml Ordering Use Cases

left to right direction

actor "總管理者\n(Admin)" as Admin
actor "倉庫管理者\n(WarehouseAdmin)" as WarehouseAdmin
actor "一般員工\n(WarehouseUser)" as WarehouseUser

WarehouseAdmin --|> WarehouseUser
Admin --|> WarehouseAdmin

rectangle "商品管理" {
    usecase "新增商品" as UC_CreateProduct
    usecase "新增單位" as UC_CreateUnit
    usecase "刪除單位" as UC_DeleteUnit
    usecase "取得單位清單" as UC_ListUnits
    usecase "取得商品清單（分頁）" as UC_ListProducts
    usecase "取得商品明細" as UC_GetProduct
}

rectangle "入庫作業" {
    usecase "申請入庫" as UC_CreateInbound
    usecase "確認/拒絕入庫單" as UC_ReviewInbound
    usecase "取得尚未處理的入庫清單" as UC_ListPendingInbound
    usecase "取得入庫單明細（限自己倉庫）" as UC_GetInbound
    usecase "取得入庫單明細（跨倉庫）" as UC_GetInboundForAdmin
}

rectangle "入庫歷程" {
    usecase "取得入庫歷程（全部倉庫，可篩選）" as UC_InboundHistory
    usecase "取得入庫歷程（限自己倉庫）" as UC_WarehouseInboundHistory
}

rectangle "出庫作業" {
    usecase "申請出庫" as UC_CreateOutbound
    usecase "確認/拒絕出庫單" as UC_ReviewOutbound
    usecase "取得尚未處理的出庫清單" as UC_ListPendingOutbound
    usecase "取得出庫單明細（限自己倉庫）" as UC_GetOutbound
    usecase "取得出庫單明細（跨倉庫）" as UC_GetOutboundForAdmin
}

rectangle "出庫歷程" {
    usecase "取得出庫歷程（全部倉庫，可篩選）" as UC_OutboundHistory
    usecase "取得出庫歷程（限自己倉庫）" as UC_WarehouseOutboundHistory
}

' 商品管理
WarehouseAdmin --> UC_CreateProduct
WarehouseAdmin --> UC_CreateUnit
WarehouseAdmin --> UC_DeleteUnit
WarehouseUser --> UC_ListUnits
WarehouseUser --> UC_ListProducts
WarehouseUser --> UC_GetProduct

' 入庫作業
WarehouseUser --> UC_CreateInbound
WarehouseAdmin --> UC_ReviewInbound
WarehouseUser --> UC_ListPendingInbound
WarehouseUser --> UC_GetInbound
Admin --> UC_GetInboundForAdmin

' 入庫歷程 —— 一般員工不可查歷程，只能查「尚未處理」
WarehouseAdmin --> UC_InboundHistory
Admin --> UC_InboundHistory
WarehouseAdmin --> UC_WarehouseInboundHistory

' 出庫作業
WarehouseUser --> UC_CreateOutbound
WarehouseAdmin --> UC_ReviewOutbound
WarehouseUser --> UC_ListPendingOutbound
WarehouseUser --> UC_GetOutbound
Admin --> UC_GetOutboundForAdmin

' 出庫歷程
Admin --> UC_OutboundHistory
WarehouseAdmin --> UC_WarehouseOutboundHistory
WarehouseUser --> UC_WarehouseOutboundHistory

note bottom of UC_CreateInbound
  WarehouseId 一律從 JWT token 取得，
  不接受前端傳入，避免冒用其他倉庫身份。
end note

note bottom of UC_ReviewOutbound
  出庫單審核前，狀態必須先從
  Processing（Inventory 尚未回覆是否有足夠庫存）
  轉成 Pending，管理員才看得到、審核得到。
  這個轉換是系統自動做的（見 aggregates.puml），
  不是一個使用者可觸發的 use case。
end note

note bottom of UC_InboundHistory
  只顯示已處理（已確認／已拒絕）的單據，
  待審核的單據在「取得尚未處理的入庫清單」查看。
  總管理者可另篩選倉庫；
  倉庫管理者從 token 取得倉庫 id，不可跨倉庫查詢。
end note

@enduml
